<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou as “Christ” art also titled,</l><l>Title of Thy ministry;</l><l>Thou art truly God’s anointed,</l><l>Even from eternity.</l><l>Thou, O Lord, art God’s Messiah;</l><l>God appointed Thee in love,</l><l>That Thou might fulfill His purpose</l><l>And to all His glory prove.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thou art also called “Emmanuel“;</l><l>“God with us” Thou cam’st to be;</l><l>God in grace is wholly mingled</l><l>With our own humanity.</l><l>God in flesh is manifested,</l><l>Full of grace and truth therein;</l><l>We have seen in Thee God’s glory,</l><l>And in faith partake of Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>How we treasure all Thy names, Lord,</l><l>How much they to us unfold;</l><l>All their worth and all their sweetness</l><l>We in love will ever hold.</l><l>Precious Savior, we adore Thee,</l><l>Worship unto Thee we bring;</l><l>Our Emmanuel we exalt Thee,</l><l>And Thy praise will ever sing.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
